  "title": "Frozen Pumpkin Pie",
  "description": "Pumpkin and ginger come together perfectly in this lovely layered pie. Vanilla ice cream is spooned into a homemade gingersnap crust, topped with a creamy, spicy pumpkin filling, and frozen. Serve it with freshly-made whipped cream and a sprinkling of ginger snap cookies.",
  "authors": [
